{
  "_note": "control.py API v1 requests actually executed for work order 002, in order, followed by the stand-alone kit build. The public API still has no modular-kit action, so the scene pipeline supplies the style reference and run record; kit_builder_v2.py builds the parts.",
  "controlApi": {
